---
title: Stack
description: Vertical layout primitive that spaces its children evenly using gap. Override the spacing with the --stack-space custom property.
tags: [layout, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<div class="stack" style="--stack-space: 1rem">
  <div>First</div>
  <div>Second</div>
  <div>Third</div>
</div>
